---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Notice" description="Information about privacy and the handling of enquiries on Mumbai Church of Christ." noindex={false}>
  <section class="section section-paper"><div class="container" style="max-width:950px">
    <span class="eyebrow">Privacy and voluntary participation</span><h1>Privacy notice.</h1>
    <p class="lead">This website provides Biblical educational resources and general suburb-level information about Churches of Christ in Mumbai and the surrounding region.</p>
    <h2>Information published on this website</h2><p>Individual meeting addresses, personal contact details and congregation member photographs are not published in the current website directory.</p>
    <h2>Enquiries</h2><p>The central contact service is not yet operational. The enquiry fields can be edited, but submission is disabled. The form does not transmit your entries to us. Please do not provide sensitive personal information through unverified channels.</p>
    <h2>Website technology</h2><p>This static website is hosted through GitHub Pages. Hosting and network providers may process technical request information. Some external links lead to third-party websites governed by their own privacy policies.</p>
    <h2>Freedom of conscience</h2><p>We respect the freedom of conscience, beliefs and choices of every person. Religious discussions and participation must be voluntary. We do not support coercion, fraud, threats or improper inducement.</p>
    <h2>Future contact service</h2><p>This notice will be updated before enquiries are enabled to describe the data collected, how it is handled, applicable retention arrangements and the means to raise privacy questions.</p>
    <p><a href="/contact/">Central contact page →</a></p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
